#. module: muk_ai_schedule
#: model:muk_ai.schedule,prompt:muk_ai_schedule.demo_schedule_overdue_inbox_digest
msgid ""
"\n"
"{{ len(records) }} activities are past their deadline. Group by `user_id`. For each assignee\n"
"with overdue items, look up their `partner_id` (`read_records` on `res.users`) then send a short\n"
"HTML digest to their Discuss inbox via `call_method` model=`mail.thread`, method=`message_notify`,\n"
"ids=`[]`, kwargs `partner_ids=[<partner_id>]`, `subject='Overdue activities — N items'`,\n"
"`body=<html top-5 with target res_model/res_id, summary, days overdue>`. No chatter posts.\n"
"Date: {{ today }}.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""

